      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Content Series",
      "Anchor": "content-series",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The ContentSeries API returns details for a content series (i.e. owner, subscriberCount, issues, cadence, etc). A \u0022Content Series\u0022 corresponds to LinkedIn\u0027s Newsletters feature, where an issue is a published article that is part of a recurring series that members and organizations can subscribe to and be notified about.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Content Series",
      "Anchor": "content-series",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The service currently provides the following methods:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Content Series",
      "Anchor": "content-series",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "GET - A single ContentSeries entity for the given contentSeriesUrn\nBATCH_GET - List of ContentSeries entities for the given set of contentSeriesUrns\nFindByOwner - List of ContentSeries entities for the given OrganizationUrn](../pages-profiles/organizations.md) or PersonUrn",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
