          },
          {
            "Text": "Retrieve your organization\u2019s posts, comments, reactions, and other engagement data. Retrieve your organization\u2019s pages and their reporting data (including follower, visitor and content analytics). Restricted to organizations in which the authenticated member has one of the following company page roles. ADMINISTRATOR",
